  "_comment_architecture": [
    "Durability tests in the compact sensorReport form of the common/assessment EPCIS binding. Same information as an oea:TestExecution with an oea:MeasurementResult at event level: the event is the execution (eventTime, readPoint say when and where); each sensorElement is one test.",
    "sensorMetadata.dataProcessingMethod names the oea:TestMethod individual, sensorMetadata.bizRules the standard's catalogue page; each sensorReport carries one result: type is the oea:PerformanceParameter IRI, value and uom the measured quantity (UN/CEFACT Rec 20; C62 for a grade or a cycle count).",
    "Use this form when a test rig or LIMS reports raw results; use the object form (observation-durability.jsonld) when conditions, settings, criteria or derived indicators belong to the record.",
    "",
    "HTTP header: GS1-Extensions: oec=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/common/core/,oea=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/common/assessment/,eutex=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/eu/textile/",
    "See: extensions/common/assessment/docs/EPCIS_BINDING.md",
    "GS1 demo prefix 952 (7-digit GCP: 9521234)."
  ],
